%% State machine of one statement: checked by code first, then by staff.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Recorded : agent calls record_statement
  Recorded --> Verified : every quote found<br/>on its page
  Recorded --> RejectedByChecker : a quote is missing<br/>(statement.rejected)
  RejectedByChecker --> [*] : agent may retry<br/>with a new statement
  Verified --> Approved : staff approve
  Verified --> Edited : staff edit the wording
  Verified --> RejectedByStaff : staff reject, with a note
  Approved --> [*]
  Edited --> [*]
  RejectedByStaff --> [*]

  Recorded : Recorded
  Verified : Verified (by code)
  RejectedByChecker : Rejected by checker
  RejectedByChecker : never shown as a fact
  Approved : Approved
  Edited : Edited
  Edited : original text kept
  RejectedByStaff : Rejected by staff
  RejectedByStaff : hidden from residents
  note left of Recorded
    An unverified statement is never shown silently:
    if one is shown at all, it carries an "unverified" label.
  end note
